    "body": "The other relevant Chrome bug is https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=692695\r\nLooks like we need a WebKit bug for changing its `returnValue` to be no more powerful than `preventDefault()` ?\r\nI couldn't find a Mozilla bug for implementing `returnValue`.",
